This is a realistic model of the rabbit toy. The model is made with attention to details. It has reasonable amount of polygons, accurate grid . 
All materials and textures are included.All parts of the model have a scan and therefore will look good even whithout fur.
Native file format is max 2014, V-Ray 3.0 .There is no fur in max 2009 file. 
Do not forget to include the effects of mr prim in Hair and Fur inside of 3ds max (key 8 on the keyboard - Environment end Effects / Effects).
