[ABOUT]Behold! There is an amazing representative of dark fantasy before your eyes. Mr. Terrible Stump is the character that will fit your fantasy project perfectly. It doesn't matter if you create a tower defense, quest or RPG game - this pack contains a few color options which will allow you to use the model in different settings.
This package contains one character skinned model, 4 texture options (PBS materials) and 38 animations. Model is fully rigged, animated and optimized for mobile devices. Model has one skinned mesh and only two joints have influence on each vertex at the same time.Model Summary: 1360 tris, 694 verts, 27 joints.
Textures: 2k maps set for PBS (metallic workflow) includes albedo, metallic/smoothness, normal, occlusion and emission.There are 3 color and glowing options in the pack. In the screenshots you can see models in Unity with standard shader and post-processing effects used. 
[ANIMATION LIST]There are 38 animation clips for the character. You can find close or distant attack, or cast spell among them.

