  - Idle02 (90 frames, well loop);

  - Jump animation (contains 5 animations: Push-UpLoop-Breakpoint-DownLoop-LandingShock);

  - Jump (single-piece animation, 30 frames, well loop);

  - Leg Kick (30 frames, well loop);

  - Panic (36 frames, well loop);

  - Power Strike (40 frames, well loop);

  - Provoke (60 frames, well loop);

