  - Cast Spell Loop (33 frames, well loop);

  - Cast Spell Launch (40 frames);

  - Stun/Sleep (30 frames, well loop); 

  - Throw (34 frames);

  - Take Damage01 (30 frames);

  - Take Damage02 (30 frames, well loop);

  - To Take Up On Guard State (31 frames);

  - On Guard Idle (30 frames, well loop); 

  - On Guard Throw (30 frames, well loop); 

  - On Guard Take Damage01 (31 frames, well loop); 

  - On Guard Take Damage02 (27 frames, well loop); 

