Please, watch the promo-video to learn more.

[ABOUT]There you can see an amazing chibi character! Cute and terrifying at the same time. Several color options, cartoon proportions, cute animations - what else you may need for a fun character!This package contains one character model, 3 texture options (PBS materials, metallic workflow) and 20 animation clips. It is fully rigged, animated and optimized for mobile devices. 
Model Summary: triangle count is 1882, 943 verts. There are 34 joints in the skeleton. Only two joints have influence on each vertex at the same time.
Textures: PBS maps set (metallic workflow) includes albedo, metallic/smoothness, normal and occlusion maps. The maps are saved in 2k resolution, but they can be reduced to 512px and still preserve their quality. In the screenshots you can see models in Unity with standard shader and post-processing effects used.
[ANIMATION LIST]

  - Idle01 (loop);

  - Idle02 (loop);

  - Look Around (loop);

  - Walk (loop);

  - Crippled Walk (loop);

  - Run (loop);

  - Attack01 (by two strokes);

  - Attack02 (low kick);

  - Attack03 (rapid strike);

  - Die01;

  - Die02;

  - Take damage;

  - Dance (loop);

  - Jump (single-piece animation);

  - Jump (splitted animation)

Please, watch the promo-video to learn more (N.B.! Not all the clips were used in the video)

